(950, '03092404122855', 'VP/I/24/09/009', 199, '64', '{\"contact_person_name\":\"Mrs. Neelam \",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"9671789075\",\"policy_number\":\"31270047222700028842\",\"insured_name\":\"Mrs. Neelam \",\"tag_vehicle\":\"1022867\\/794225\",\"cause_loss\":\"\",\"location_survey\":\"Bahadurgarh Jhajjar Haryana \",\"workshop_name\":\"\",\"workshop_advisor_name\":\"\",\"instruction\":\"NA\",\"surveyor_observation\":null}', '{\"case_reference\": \"VP\\/I\\/24\\/09\\/009\", \"date_of_report\": \"03-09-2024\", \"insurer\": \"1\", \"nameofowner\": \"Mrs. Neelam \", \"district\": \"Bahadurgarh \", \"state\": \"Haryana \", \"periodOfCoverage\": \"12-07-2022\", \"dateOfDisease\": \"06-06-2023\", \"ContactNumber\": \"9671789075\", \"tagNumber\": \"1022867\\/794225\", \"typeOfAnimal\": \"Cow\", \"dateOfDeath\": \"06-06-2023\", \"timeOfDeath\": \"2:30 PM\", \"dateOfSurvey\": \"06-06-2023\", \"timeOfSurvey\": \"8:00 PM\", \"days_between_policy_and_disease\": \"330\", \"deathOrDisablement\": \"Death\", \"SurveyConducted\": \"Yes\", \"tag_tempered\": \"Yes\", \"cattle_buried\": \"No\", \"remark\": \"No Claim\", \"whysurveyNotConducted\": \"\", \"aid\": \"03092404122855\", \"natureofjob\": \"64\", \"policy_by\": \"THE NEW INDIA ASSURANCE CO. LTD\", \"policy_branch\": \"Divisional Office Badshah Khan Chowk, Faridabad (Haryana)\", \"policy_user\": \"Mr. Shashi Prakash\", \"policy_mobile\": \"+919868998030\", \"appoint_by\": \"HINDUSTAN INSURANCE BROKERS LTD.\", \"appointment_branch_name\": \"201-202, Bhanot Chamber, 3rd, Panchkuian Marg, behind Delhi Heart & Lung Institute, Aram Bagh, Nueva Delhi, New Delhi (Delhi)\", \"appointment_user_name\": \"Mr. Umesh Sarin\", \"appointment_mobile_num\": \"+919599556790\", \"payment_by\": \"THE NEW INDIA ASSURANCE CO. LTD\", \"payment_branch_name\": \"Divisional Office Badshah Khan Chowk, Faridabad (Haryana)\", \"payment_gst\": \"06AAACN4165C2ZU\", \"payment_user_name\": \"Mr. Shashi Prakash\", \"payment_mobile_num\": \"+919868998030\"}', '{\"salutation\":\"W\\/O\",\"guardian_name\":\"Sanjeet \",\"aadhar_number\":\"9543 4300 2739\",\"address_of_insured\":\"682, Village Parnala Bahadurgarh Haryana - 124507\",\"pan_number\":\"CGUPN7446P\",\"familyIDNumber\":\"2PFZ7773\",\"dateofInsurance\":\"22-01-2021\",\"insuredCategory\":\"General\",\"healthDatePicker\":\"12-07-2022\",\"HelthCertificate\":\"825860\",\"policyNumber\":\"31270047222700028842\",\"periodCovTo\":\"11-07-2023\",\"amount1\":\"40000\",\"amount2\":\"1490\",\"milkingCapacity\":\"10 Ltr \",\"doctorName\":\"Dr. Adarsh \",\"breed\":\"HFX\",\"birthNaturalMark\":\"Black & White \",\"Gender\":\"Female\",\"totalAnimal\":\"05\",\"totalAnimalInsured\":\"02\",\"anyLoanTaken\":\"Yes\",\"individualFamily\":\"Individual Family \",\"nameOfBank\":\"SARVA HARYANA GRAMIN BANK \",\"loanRunning\":\"Yes\",\"accountNumberInput\":\"SARVA HARYANA GRAMIN BANK \",\"accountNumber_saving_account\":\"80618300000156\",\"accountHolder\":\"MRS. NEELAM \",\"ifscCode\":\"PUNB0HGB001\",\"bankDetails\":\"Passbook\",\"animalDisposal\":\"Buried \",\"calvingDate\":\"May-2022\",\"pregnant\":\"Yes\",\"pmr\":\"Yes\",\"reason_of_death\":\"Sudden Death \",\"dateTimePostMortem\":\"07-06-2023\",\"pmr_time\":\"7:00 AM\",\"nameOfdoctor\":\"Dr. Adarsh \",\"doctorContactNumber\":\"9588192923\",\"breedAsPerPMR\":\"HFX\",\"ageOfAnimal\":\"06 Years 05 Month \",\"tagAsPerPMR\":\"102867\\/794225\",\"milk_capacity\":\"NA\",\"clean_pmr\":\"Yes\",\"causeOfDeathAsPerPMR\":\"Acute Cardiac Arrest \",\"causeOfDeathAsPerInsured\":\"Sudden Death \",\"treatment_chart\":\"NA\",\"treatmentDate\":\"\",\"whoAdministeredTreatment\":\"\",\"administeredTreatment\":\"\",\"satisfactory_and_sufficient\":\"\",\"bankIOwnerAddress\":\"SARVA HARYANA GRAMIN BANK \",\"physicalHealth\":\"physicalHealth_1\",\"gapsBetweenTreatment\":\"NA\",\"dateAndAmountOfPurchase\":\"Own Reared \",\"physicalHealthOfAnimal\":\"40000\",\"anyDisavility\":\"NA\",\"statement_of_insured\":\"Our investigators have also enquired from the above named claimant\\/insured who has confirmed about the said incident and has given a written statement to the said effect. The statement is enclosed.\",\"statement_of_villagers\":\"Not Available \",\"statement_of_two_authorized\":\"Not Available \",\"observation_4\":\"NA\",\"observation_1\":\"NA\",\"observation_2\":\"NA\",\"observation_3\":\"Yes\",\"observation_5\":\"NA\",\"observation_7\":\"Yes\",\"observation_8\":\"No\",\"observation_9\":\"NA\",\"vs_signature_on_pmr\":\"NA\",\"vs_stamp_on_pmr\":\"NA\",\"period_of_treatment_days\":\"NA\",\"signed_by_tehsildar\":\"NA\",\"signed_by_sarpanch\":\"NA\",\"tag_number_clear\":\"NA\",\"dead_animal_photo_attached\":\"NA\",\"tag_number_as_per_policy\":\"NA\",\"health_certificate_option\":\"NA\",\"pmr_option\":\"NA\",\"policy_copy\":\"NA\",\"health_certificate\":\"NA\",\"claim_intimation_letter\":\"NA\",\"discharge_voucher\":\"NA\",\"sc_certificate\":\"NA\",\"account_number\":\"NA\",\"pmr_with_signature\":\"NA\",\"treatment_chart_option\":\"NA\",\"insured_statement\":\"NA\",\"claim_form_with_signature\":\"NA\",\"copy_of_adhar_card\":\"NA\",\"photo_of_dead\":\"No\",\"investigator_report\":\"NA\",\"tag_available\":\"NA\",\"fir_attached\":\"NA\",\"remarkObservation\":\"We visited for re-investigation of the subjected claim at the residence of the beneficiary Mrs. Neelam. She informed us that at the time of investigation of death of her cattle no investigator actually reached at her place. She was helped by her husband, Mr. Sanjeet in doing the video survey of the dead cattle. She arranged the virtual survey and submitted the video of the dead cattle and the tag removal herself. Thus, as far as the survey and investigation is concerned it is informed by beneficiary that it was a virtual survey. This may be confirmed from the investigator as well. \\r\\n \\r\\nWe took the statement of Mr. Sanjeet, husband of Mrs. Neelam. He in video informed us that no one came for the survey \\/ investigation originally. They asked the photos on WhatsApp only. He confirmed that his cattle died on 06.06.2023. The tag was intact at the time of loss and he took it out safely. He did not agree to any wrong doing in this case, yet the fact remains whatever happened was never checked and verified by any investigator physically.\\r\\n\\r\\nNow going through the video of tag removal it is clear that the tag removed is not as typically seen or done by us in almost all the cases. The tag came out very easily as can be seen in the video. The tag seems to have been already cut and removed from the ear. The tag removed is clearly without back part and the ear punch is also seen very large which is not seen in any of the cases where tag is freshly and safely removed by us during physical investigation.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe also found that the beneficiary has many other cattle assets which are uninsured and without tag. Though the date of insurance and date of death are far enough and does not raise doubt. Yet, since there are many uninsured cattle hence there are a possibility that the dead cattle could different from the insured cattle.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor this we called the photos of the live animal and tallied the same with the photos given by the insured to investigator. We found the deceased cattle was a cow. The cow had some very distinctive features i.e. patches on face, legs and body lower portion. The live animal is same as per the photos of the said deceased animal. There is no doubt hence the dead animal & live animal are same.\\r\\n\\r\\nHence, looking to all the above it is established that the beneficiary showed the insured animal in the photos and videos given by them to the investigator during their virtual survey. The tag was tampered as can be seen in the video taken at the time of loss. The photos don\\u2019t show any tampered tag. Thus, possibly the tag got tampered whilst being taken out. Had the investigator been to the spot there would not have been any doubt in this case and tag would have been taken out safely in presence of the investigator.\\r\\n\\r\\nThus, this seems to be a genuine case in our opinion and is recommended for payment to the beneficiary.                                             \\r\\n                                                                                                                \",\"aid\":\"03092404122855\",\"physicalHealthText\":\"Good Health\",\"observation_6\":\"NA\"}', '', '[\"WhatsApp_Image_2024-09-03_at_13.52.29.jpeg\",\"WhatsApp_Image_2024-09-03_at_13.52.33.jpeg\"]', '', '', '1', NULL, '2024-09-03 10:42:28'),
