mage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition already shifted to Timarpur Parking. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Bumper, RHS Fender, RHS Headlight, RHS Both Doors, RHS ORVM, RHS Quarter Panel, Rear Bumper, RHS Both Side Wheel Rims and Tyres, Dashboard with fitments, RHS Side Airbags, Airbag Controller and Module, etc damaged. LHS Front Bumper damaged. LHS Rear Door showing old dents.\",\"load_body\":\"\",\"cooling_system\":\"Suspected damaged.\",\"steering_system\":\"Suspected damaged.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for RHS Suspension.\",\"electrical_system\":\"RHS Headlight, Dashboard with RHS Fitments, Wirings etc damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Foundations.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Front and Rear Right Members To Check.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"NO\",\"fitness\":\"NO\",\"goods_tax\":\"NO\",\"permit\":\"NO\",\"has_accidenty\":\"NO\",\"if_yes\":\"NO\",\"remarks\":\"Some documents received on Dec 2024, As such report released accordingly.\\r\\n\\r\\nRHS Rear Wheel Bent. To Check for Rear Axle.\",\"aid\":\"24122410353824\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Motor Cab\",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '1', NULL, '2024-12-24 05:05:38'),
