save, insured\'s driver also applied brakes and steered to right but vehicle got disbalanced and hit \\/ ran over divider and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with Front fitments i.e. Front Bumper, FUPD, Under Panel, Under Cover etc damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for Front Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"To Check for wirings.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for foundation, Oil Chamber etc. However Oil not looking spilled out.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. Front Cross Member damaged. To Check for Front Axle, Tie Rod etc.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"17012503300064\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '6', NULL, '2025-01-17 10:00:00'),
