re spot survey. \",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of driver, while going, suddenly Side running container turned towards insured vehicle. To save, insured driver steered the vehicle but vehicle got uncontrolled and hit with the road side pavement and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with Front and LHS Fitments i.e. Front Windshield Glass, Front Bumper, LHS Headlight, LHS Footrest, LHS Side Panel, etc damaged. LHS Side Rear Tyre damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"LHS Side Body damaged. LHS Rear Side Floor To Check. LHS SUPD damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Suspected damaged.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"LHS Leaf Springs To Check for Hair Crack.\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight damaged. Wirings To Check.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Foundations.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"To Check for Both Axles. Chassis Both Long Members Misaligned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p><b>Stepney uprooted breaking the stepney bracket. The stepney tyre got cut by railing. LHS Rear Inner &amp; Outer Tyre also got cut by railing.<\\/b><\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"18012512345934\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '6', NULL, '2025-01-18 07:04:59'),
