and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with front fitments i.e. Front Panel, Front Bumper, RHS Headlight, Front Windshield Glass, RHS door with fitments, RHS ORVM, Front Grille, RHS Mudguard, etc damaged. \",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for Front Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"RHS Headlight damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for foundation.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"To Check for Front Axle. Chassis Long Members Misaligned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"22012512375071\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-01-22 07:07:50'),
