dress\":\"Sector 48, Sohna Road, Gurugram, Haryana\",\"registered_owner\":\"M\\/s Sure Cargo Control Private Limited\",\"insurancefrom\":\"12-04-2024\",\"insurancefromtime\":\"(00:00 Hrs)\",\"insuranceto\":\"11-04-2025\",\"financers\":\"HDFC Bank Ltd\",\"sum_insured\":\"Rs. 39,06,876\\/-\",\"aid\":\"27012501223730\",\"natureofjob\":\"62\"}', '{\"registration_date\":\"27-04-2023\",\"chasis_no\":\"MEC816EBCPP137327\",\"engine_no\":\"926956D0143131 - DIESEL\",\"make_model\":\"Bharatbenz 2823R 6X2 BS VI \\/ 2023\",\"body_type\":\"Closed Body\",\"tax_paid\":\"31-03-2025\",\"vehicle_class\":\"goods_carrier\",\"ulw\":\"10580 kgs\",\"rlw\":\"28000 kgs\",\"carrying_capacity\":\"03 in RC, 02 as per Insurance\",\"pre_acccident\":\"Normal\",\"fitness_certificate_no\":\"Not Provided\",\"valid_up_to\":\"20-04-2025 (RTO Sheet)\",\"permit_no\":\"HR2023-NP-3232B\",\"permit_validityfrom\":\"02-05-2023\",\"permit_validity\":\"01-05-2028\",\"permit_type\":\"National Permit Goods Carrier\",\"area_of_operation\":\"All India Consolidated\",\"authorization\":\"NP\\/HR\\/55\\/042024\\/114869\",\"authorization_from\":\"27-04-2024\",\"autharity_validity\":\"27-04-2025\",\"puc\":\"05-04-2025\",\"survey_date\":\"22-11-2024\",\"name_of_driver\":\"Mr. Vijay\",\"driving_license_no\":\"UP76 20150000229\",\"dl_issuedate\":\"07-01-2015\",\"dl_valid\":\"09-05-2033 (NT) 05-03-2025 (TR)\",\"dob\":\"10-05-1983\",\"issuing_authority\":\"Farrukhabad, UP\",\"license_type\":\"Permanent\",\"type_of_vehicle_allowed\":\"MCWG, LMV & TRANS Only\",\"verified_driving_license\":\"No - Photocopy - RTO Sheet Enclosed\",\"endorse\":\"Trans w.e.f. 06-03-2017\",\"place_of_accident\":\"Gwalior - Dabra Highway, Gwalior, MP\",\"date_of_incident\":\"20-11-2024\",\"time_of_incident\":\"07:30PM\",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"22-11-2024\",\"date_of_inspection\":\"22-11-2024\",\"place_of_inspection\":\"Spot of Accident\",\"third_party_particulars\":\"As per statement of driver - No.\",\"loan_challan\":\"As per Statement of driver & GR - 1120 Boxes vide LR No: 241770, eWB No: 221860552636 & Invoice No: CND\\/24-25\\/6640 dated 18-11-2024 ex Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra to Nuh, Haryana. 13440 kgs.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of driver, insured vehicle was parked. some unknown truck, while overtaking from LHS Side, coming in front of insured\'s vehicle and hit the insured at front with rear of T P Truck and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition already shifted to roadside to avoid traffic jam. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with Front & LHS Fitments i.e. Front Bumper, Front Windshield Glass, Front Panel, Front Grille, LHS Headlight, LHS ORVM, LHS Door with fitments i.e. damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for LHS Front Suspension. To Check for Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight damaged. To Check for Dashboard inner fitments. \",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Foundations.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. To Check for Front Axle.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"27012501223730\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-01-27 07:52:37'),
