th Butterflies weight approx 300kgs. Details To Check by Final Surveyor.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per Claim Form, While going, suddenly a car came in front of insured vehicle. To save, insured driver steered the vehicle but could not controlled and ran over road side divider and overturned and insured vehicle got damaged \",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with major fitments i.e. Front Panel, Front Bumper, LHS Headlight, etc damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"RHS \\/ SUPD damaged. Body Alignment To Check as vehicle had overturned.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check as vehicle is overturned and Front Axle uprooted. \",\"steering_system\":\"Steering box damaged. Linkages, Tie Rods damaged.\",\"suspension\":\"Front Suspension damaged. Rear Leaf Springs also To Check as vehicle had overturned.\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight damaged. Other wirings also To Check. Batteries Acid leaked as vehicle overturned.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Foundations.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Bent. Front Axle uprooted and damaged. Rear Axle also To Check as vehicle had overturned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p>As Front Axle has uprooted and pushed back, Under Carriage Loss To Be Check.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"30012502390462\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-01-30 09:09:04'),
