ds.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of driver, while going, suddenly a car collided with the insured vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged. During discussion with driver on phone, it was informed that a car while overtaking from LHS Side, hit the insured vehicle at LHS Side. To save, as insured\'s driver steered to RHS, the vehicle collided with the divider and got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition already shifted to roadside to avoid traffic jam. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with front major fitments i.e. Front Bumper with RHS Light, RHS Door with fitments, RHS Panel, RHS Mudguard, RHS Headlight, Front Panel, RHS Tyre, FUPD, RHS Footstep etc damaged. There is dent on LHS Fender also.\",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for Front Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"RHS Headlight, Bumper Light damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Foundation.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Front Axle To Check. Chassis Long Members Misaligned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>RHS Wheel was pushed back, RHS Front Tyre was deflated. To Check for any cut.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"03022510434052\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-02-03 17:13:40'),
