 26497 dated 30.01.2025. \",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per Claim Form, while going, suddenly tyre got burst and insured vehicle got uncontrolled and ran over divider \\/ came to other side and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cowl with major fitments i.e. Both Headlights with Both Bumper Lights, Front Panel, Front Bumper, FUPD, Windshield Glass, Both Side Panels, Both Side Bodies, Both Mudguards, Both Footrest, Under Cover, Cabin Roof etc damaged. \",\"load_body\":\"To Check for Under Body damage.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Suspected damaged as vehicle ran over divider. Front Grill could not be opened.\",\"steering_system\":\"Damaged as Front & 2nd Axle Uprooted and damaged.\",\"suspension\":\"Damaged as Front & 2nd Axle Uprooted and damaged. Both Axles Leaf Springs damaged.\",\"electrical_system\":\"Both Headlights with Both Bumper Lights, Wirings damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Foundation.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. Front & 2nd Axle Uprooted and damaged.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p>Under Carriage loss. Tyre pressed under CNG Cylinder.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"11022511033733\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-02-11 05:33:37'),
