rd_party_particulars\":\"As per Statement of Driver - No.\",\"loan_challan\":\"As per Statement of driver - Loaded with wooden frame. Details To Check by Final Surveyor.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"While going, suddenly front coming vehicle steered towards insured vehicle. To save, insured driver also steered the vehicle but vehicle got uncontrolled and ran over road side pavement \\/ railings and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with few fitments i.e. Front Bumper, LHS Side Panel, LHS Door, LHS Mudguard, LHS Footrest, Under Panel, etc damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged but can be checked for foundation. U Bolts and complete body had pushed forward due to impact.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check as vehicle ran over side pavement.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check as vehicle ran over side pavement.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check as vehicle ran over side pavement.\",\"electrical_system\":\"Wirings To Check as vehicle ran over side pavement.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for foundations as vehicle ran over side pavement.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Front Axle To Check as vehicle ran over side pavement. Chassis Long Members Misaligned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>RC RTO Sheet showing Digitally Impound due to Driving License. Insured was requested to please get the same cleared.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"12022512313177\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-02-12 07:01:31'),
