ehicle and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with major fitments i.e. Front Windshield Glass, Front Panel, Front Bumper, FUPD, LHS Headlight, LHS Door with fitments, Front Grille, Wiper System etc damaged\",\"load_body\":\"LHS Front Corner damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check as Front Impact.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for Front Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight damaged. Wirings To Check.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for foundation.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. Front Axle To Check.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p>RC RTO Sheet showing DL digitally impounded. Insured was requested to please get the same cleared.&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"14022503270282\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-02-14 09:57:02'),
