5\",\"financers\":\"Yes Bank Ltd\",\"sum_insured\":\"Rs. 47,02,500\\/-\",\"aid\":\"22022511240645\",\"natureofjob\":\"62\"}', '{\"registration_date\":\"15-03-2023\",\"chasis_no\":\"MEC862FCAPP131330\",\"engine_no\":\"926956D0138001 - DIESEL\",\"make_model\":\"Bharatbenz 5428TT 4X2 BSVI \\/ 2023\",\"body_type\":\"TIP Trailor\",\"tax_paid\":\"30-06-2025\",\"vehicle_class\":\"goods_carrier\",\"ulw\":\"16000 kgs\",\"rlw\":\"55000 kgs\",\"carrying_capacity\":\"03 in all\",\"pre_acccident\":\"Normal\",\"fitness_certificate_no\":\"Nil\",\"valid_up_to\":\"12-03-2025\",\"permit_no\":\"NOT PROVIDED\",\"permit_validityfrom\":\"16-03-2023\",\"permit_validity\":\"15-03-2028\",\"permit_type\":\"National Permit Goods Carrier\",\"area_of_operation\":\"All India Consolidated\",\"authorization\":\"NP\\/HR\\/38\\/032024\\/67769\",\"authorization_from\":\"14-03-2024\",\"autharity_validity\":\"15-03-2025\",\"puc\":\"20-03-2025\",\"survey_date\":\"11-02-2025\",\"name_of_driver\":\"Mr. Gulfan\",\"driving_license_no\":\"UP22 20160007447\",\"dl_issuedate\":\"22-06-2016\",\"dl_valid\":\"21-06-2036 (NT), 29-06-2026 (TR)\",\"dob\":\"01-01-1996\",\"issuing_authority\":\"Rampur, UP\",\"license_type\":\"Permanent\",\"type_of_vehicle_allowed\":\"LMV & TRANS Only\",\"verified_driving_license\":\"No - Photocopy - RTO Sheet Enclosed\",\"endorse\":\"Trans w.e.f. 30-06-2021\",\"place_of_accident\":\"Rampur Sahahbad Road Vill Ravri Kalan, UP\",\"date_of_incident\":\"11-02-2025\",\"time_of_incident\":\"04:00 AM\",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"11-02-2025\",\"date_of_inspection\":\"11-02-2025\",\"place_of_inspection\":\"Spot of Accident\",\"third_party_particulars\":\"As per Claim Form - NA.\",\"loan_challan\":\"As per Invoice received - loaded with sand vide Invoice No. 10315 dated 11.02.2025 weight 37.9 ton x ex Bazpur to Ganaur. GR Attached.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"While going, suddenly a vehicle came in front of insured vehicle, to save that vehicle, Insured\'s driver applied emergency brakes but insured vehicle got uncontrolled and overturned to LHS Side and insured vehicle got damaged. \",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:. \",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with Front and LHS Fitments i.e. Front Windshield Glass, Front Bumper, LHS Door with fitments, LHS Major fitments, LHS Side Body, LHS Side Panel, LHS Headlight etc damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"Trailer LHS Side Wall, Floor etc damaged. Trailer RHS Side Wall tilted to LHS Side. Trailer All Axles, All Leaf Springs To Check. Trailer Chassis Misaligned. 5th wheel To Check. LHS SUPD damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Suspected damaged as vehicle overturned to LHS Side. To Check for Cooling System,\",\"steering_system\":\"Suspected damaged as vehicle overturned to LHS Side.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for All Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight, Wirings etc damaged. Batteries To Check.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Mountings.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Prime Mover All Axles To Check. Prime Mover Chassis Misaligned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>As vehicle was overturned while running on road, Jack did not opened, However To Be Checked for Jack Rods, Brackets etc.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Lift Axle was not looking Lifted.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"22022511240645\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-02-22 05:54:06'),
