accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Major Under Carriage Loss.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"24022504335426\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Bus\",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-02-24 11:03:54'),
