ur Spot Survey. To Check.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"While going, suddenly a car overtook insured vehicle and came in front of insured vehicle and steered left right. Due to this, insured\'s driver got confused and vehicle got uncontrolled and hit the LHS Divider and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition shifted to roadside to avoid traffic jam. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Cowl, LHS Headlight, LHS Door, LHS Windshield Glass, LHS Pillar, LHS Side Protector, Front Bumper, Front Panel, LHS Side Body, LHS Side Panel, etc damaged. \",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check.\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. To Check for Front Axle.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Insured forwarded documents on 17.02.2025, as such report released accordingly.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"27022511413527\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods and Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-02-27 06:11:35'),
