vehicle applied emergency brakes. To save, insured\'s driver also applied brakes and steered the vehicle but still collided at the back of front vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Bonnet, Front Bumper, Front Windshield Glass, Front Grille, Both Fenders, LHS Headlight, Roof with Trim, Front Members, LHS Major fitments, Passenger Door, LHS ORVM, Wiper Complete System, LHS Side Body, LHS Window Glass, Front Both Pillars, Dashboard with fitments, etc damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"Body Left Wall, LHS Front Door, Roof etc damaged. Seat Damaged\",\"cooling_system\":\"Suspected damaged.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check for LHS Link Rod.\",\"suspension\":\"Front Suspension decambed. To Check for any Hair Crack.\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight, Dashboard with fitments, Wirings damaged. \",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Mountings.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. Front Axle bent.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"Not till Spot Survey.\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"Driver holding DL for LMV(NT) where vehicle is 26 seater traveller carrying 22 passengers. Please check during final survey.&nbsp;\",\"aid\":\"27022503312477\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Bus\",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-02-27 10:01:24'),
