(2317, '05032502233857', 'VP/M/24/12/035', 394, '66', '{\"name_of_consignee\":\"M\\/s. DAS Distributers Pvt. Ltd., Bhiwandi (MH), M\\/s. Meyer Organics Pvt. Ltd., Bhiwandi (MH) & M\\/s. Micropark Enterprises, Nagpur (MH)\",\"salutation\":\"Mr\",\"name_of_commodity\":\"Medicines\",\"address\":\"Dehradun, Uttaranchal\",\"available_at_location\":\"yes\",\"cause_loss\":\"Loss occurred during transit from Dehradun (UK) to Bhiwandi, Nagpur (MH). According to the police report No. 0179\\/2024 lodged at Maksi, Sajapur Police Station (MP) dated 04\\/12\\/2024, the vehicle no. HR 46E 5360 loaded with medicines was going from Dehradun to Indore on dated 27\\/11\\/2024. On 28\\/11\\/2024 when the vehicle reached at Maksi bye pass road, an unknown person told to driver of the carrying vehicle that their lock of the container was open. The driver stopped the vehicle and checked that the lock was opened then checked and he found that total 87 cartons of medicines were short. The lock of the container was broken by some unknown thieves and cartons were found stolen. The shortage details given as CN No. 500232002068 3 boxes short out of 6, CN No. 522232002071 all 10 boxes short, CN No. 500232002070 36 boxes short out of 38 boxes and CN No. 100019081002300 all 38 boxes were short. Hence the shortages occurred.\",\"contact_person_name\":\"Chandrabhan\",\"invoices\":[{\"invoicenumber\":\"DD12425\\/GIS01520\",\"invoicedate\":\"2024-11-23\"},{\"invoicenumber\":\"DD12425\\/GIS01524\",\"invoicedate\":\"2024-11-26\"},{\"invoicenumber\":\"DD12425\\/GIS01525\",\"invoicedate\":\"2024-11-26\"},{\"invoicenumber\":\"DD12425\\/GIS01526\",\"invoicedate\":\"2024-11-26\"}],\"case_reference\":\"VP\\/M\\/24\\/12\\/035\",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"9300168229\"}', '{\"policy_by\":\"IFFCO TOKIO GENERAL INSURANCE CO. LTD.\",\"appoint_by\":\"IFFCO TOKIO GENERAL INSURANCE CO. LTD.\",\"payment_by\":\"IFFCO TOKIO GENERAL INSURANCE CO. LTD.\",\"selected_policy_vendor_id\":\"258\",\"policy_branch\":\"3RD &amp; 