tement of driver - loaded with Courier Items. Material was shifted to another vehicle before Spot Survey.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"While going, suddenly front running vehicle applied emergency brakes. To save, insured\'s driver also applied brakes but still collided at the back of front vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. The goods loaded were already transfered. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with front major fitments i.e. Front Windshield Glass, Front Panel, Front Bumper, FUPD, LHS Headlight, Wiper System, LHS Door with fitments, Dashboard with Fitments, LHS Footrest, Both Side Panels, LHS Side Body,  etc damaged. \",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Suspected damaged. \",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for Front Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight, Dashboard with fitments, damaged. Wirings To Check.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for foundations.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. Front Axle To Check.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General. <\\/p><p>RC-RTO sheet showing Impound due to&nbsp; 3&nbsp; occurences.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"06032512185917\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-03-05 18:48:59'),
