. Khekda Baghpat (U.P.) to Jind (Haryana). \",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of driver, the opposite coming lane was closed and traffic of both side moving on single lane, suddenly front coming vehicle hit Insured\\u2019s vehicle at front and Insured vehicle got damaged. \",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition already shifted to roadside to avoid traffic jam. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:.\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin with front fitments i.e. Front Bumper, Front Windshield Glass, RHS Door with fitments, Both Headlights, Wiper System, RHS ORVM, Front Panel, Both Side Panels, Dashboard with fitments, Front Grille, etc damaged. \",\"load_body\":\"LHS Side Corner, Pillar damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Damaged\",\"steering_system\":\"To check. Should be damaged due to front impact.\",\"suspension\":\"Front both Leaf Springs decambed. To Check for Hair Crack. \",\"electrical_system\":\"Both Headlights, Dashboard with fitments, Wirings etc damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To check for Foundations.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members front few cross members Misaligned. Front Axle To Check.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"Yes  P.S Khekra (UP)\",\"if_yes\":\"To Check.\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"08032511044095\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-03-08 05:34:40'),
