ontrolled and ran over road side divider and came to other side and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition already shifted to roadside to avoid traffic jam. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Windshield Glass, Front Bumper, FUPD, Roof Frame, Right Front Pillar, RHS Mudguard, RHS ORVM, Grille, RHS Door etc damaged. To Check for Both Headlights.\",\"load_body\":\"To Check for Floor, All Axles, Chassis Long Members, All Leaf Springs as had ran over divider.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check as vehicle ran over divider.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for All Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"To Check for Both Headlights.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Mountings.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. To Check for All Axles as vehicle ran over divider.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>To Check For Trailer Wheel Rims &amp; Tyres as 2-3 tyres were torn and rim bent.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Load Body:&nbsp;<b>To Check for Floor, All Axles, Chassis Long Members, All Leaf Springs.<\\/b><\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"08032511415245\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-03-08 06:11:52'),
