(2418, '15032511011157', 'VP/V/25/01/123', 385, '62', '{\"name_of_owner\":\"M\\/s. Alliance Carrier and Contractors\",\"type_of_vehicle\":\"goods_carrier\",\"salutation\":\"Mr\",\"address\":\"Bhilwara, Rajasthan\",\"available_at_location\":\"yes\",\"cause_loss\":\"While going, suddenly front running vehicle applied emergency brakes. To save, insured driver also applied brakes but still collided at the back of front vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"contact_person_name\":\"Islam\",\"claim_no\":\"NA\",\"case_reference\":\"VP\\/V\\/25\\/01\\/123\",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"7696318576\",\"policyNumber\":\"215502\\/31\\/2024\\/1167\",\"insured_name\":\"M\\/s. Alliance Carrier and Contractors\",\"tag_vehicle\":\"HR-55X-3939\",\"vehicle_number\":\"HR-55X-3939\"}', '{\"policy_by\":\"THE ORIENTAL INSURANCE COMPANY LIMITED\",\"appoint_by\":\"THE ORIENTAL INSURANCE COMPANY LIMITED\",\"payment_by\":\"THE ORIENTAL INSURANCE COMPANY LIMITED\",\"selected_policy_vendor_id\":\"260\",\"policy_branch\":\"BO MAYAPURI 9.COMMUNITY CENTER PHASE 1 MAYAPURI, New Delhi ,Delhi - 110007\",\"policy_user\":\"Mr. AMIT  GOEL\",\"policy_mobile\":\"+911128115729\",\"policybillingto\":\"GH000000054769\",\"selected_appointment_vendor_id\":\"260\",\"appointment_gst\":\"07AAACT0627R1Z1\",\"appointment_branch_name\":\"BO MAYAPURI 9.COMMUNITY CENTER PHASE 1 MAYAPURI, New Delhi ,Delhi - 110007\",\"appointment_user_name\":\"Mr. AMIT  GOEL\",\"appointment_mobile_num\":\"+911128115729\",\"appointbillingto\":\"GH000000054769\",\"selected_payment_vendor_id\":\"260\",\"payment_gst\":\"07AAACT0627R1Z1\",\"payment_branch_name\":\"BO MAYAPURI 9.COMMUNITY CENTER PHASE 1 MAYAPURI, New Delhi ,Delhi - 110007\",\"payment_user_name\":\"Mr. AMIT  GOEL\",\"payment_mobile_num\":\"+911128115729\",\"paymentbillingto\":\"GH000000054769\",\"vehicle_number\":\"HR-55X-3939\",\"insured_name\":\"M\\/s. Alliance Carrier and Contractors\",\"date_of_report\":\"15-03-2025\",\"policyNumber\":\"215502\\/31\\/2024\\/1167\",\"claim_no\":\"NA\",\"case_reference\":\"VP\\/V\\/25\\/01\\/123\",\"insured_address\":\"3968, Roshanara Road, Delhi- 110007\",\"registered_owner\":\"M\\/s. Alliance Carrier and Contractors\",\"insurancefrom\":\"01-03-2024\",\"insurancefromtime\":\"(00:00 Hrs)\",\"insuranceto\":\"28-02-2025\",\"financers\":\"-\",\"sum_insured\":\"Rs. 7,50,000\\/-\",\"aid\":\"15032511011157\",\"natureofjob\":\"62\"}', '{\"registration_date\":\" 01-04-2016\",\"chasis_no\":\"MA1PCAL8CF6K47646\",\"engine_no\":\"6EFZX13557\",\"make_model\":\"Mahindra TRUXO - 25 \\/ 2016\",\"body_type\":\"Closed\",\"tax_paid\":\"31-12-2025\",\"vehicle_class\":\"goods_carrier\",\"ulw\":\"9500\",\"rlw\":\"28000\",\"carrying_capacity\":\"02 in all\",\"pre_acccident\":\"Normal\",\"fitness_certificate_no\":\"Nil\",\"valid_up_to\":\"04-04-2025\",\"permit_no\":\"2899\\/NP\\/16\",\"permit_validityfrom\":\"04-04-2016\",\"permit_validity\":\"31-03-2026\",\"permit_type\":\"National Permit Goods Carrier\",\"area_of_operation\":\"All India Consolidated\",\"authorization\":\"NP\\/HR\\/55\\/052024\\/28044\",\"authorization_from\":\"08-05-2024\",\"autharity_validity\":\"31-03-2025\",\"puc\":\"08-04-2025\",\"survey_date\":\"31-01-2025\",\"name_of_driver\":\" Mr. Krishna Awtar Saroj\",\"driving_license_no\":\"UP7220070001611\",\"dl_issuedate\":\"26-09-2007\",\"dl_valid\":\"11-04-2035 (NT), 06-01-2027(TR) \",\"dob\":\"13-08-1988\",\"issuing_authority\":\"Pratapgarh, UP\",\"license_type\":\"Permanent\",\"type_of_vehicle_allowed\":\"LMV, MCWG & TRANS Only\",\"verified_driving_license\":\"No - Photocopy RTO Sheet Enclosed\",\"endorse\":\"TRANS w.e.f 25-02-2009\",\"place_of_accident\":\"Bhilwara, Rajasthan\",\"date_of_incident\":\"to check\",\"time_of_incident\":\"to check\",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"29-01-2025\",\"date_of_inspection\":\"31-01-2025\",\"place_of_inspection\":\"Kartar Carrier, Pillar No. 143, UP Border\",\"third_party_particulars\":\"NA\",\"loan_challan\":\"Loaded with Grocery items material was shifted to another vehicle before spot survey.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"While going, Front Running Vehicle suddenly applied emergency brakes. To save, insured driver also applied brakes but still collided at the back of front vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the insured\'s godown at UP Border. The above vehicle was standing in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front show dented at left, Left windshield broken, Front grill bent, Left headlight panel damaged, cabin left wall badly broken, Roof damaged, Inside sunmica damaged, Dashboard damaged at left, Left headlight broken, Front bumper damaged at left, Left RVM Bracket damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"Container front wall, Left front corner, Left wall at front damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To check ,However as vehicle had been driven from bhilwara to UP Border on its own power, No damage to cooling system.\",\"steering_system\":\"Not damaged, However may be checked for minor work.\",\"suspension\":\"Front left springs decambed.\",\"electrical_system\":\"Wiring to check, Battery OK.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"Not damaged, However Left front foundation to check.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Misaligned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>Name of driver as per documents is krishna awtar saroj, however as per statements is sintu saroj. Nick name of driver.<\\/p><p>As per statement of person available during spot survey, after the accident, driver got injured. Police were not allowing to stop the vehicle at spot. The vehicle was in running condition. Goods also were loaded in truck as such the driver had driven the vehicle to UP border where spot survey arranged. It is subject to Insurance company considering the same.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"15032511011157\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-03-15 05:31:11'),
