ront vehicle and Insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition, Shifted to nearby godown. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front cabin with major RHS Fitments, Front Panel, RHS Door with fitments, Wiper System, Front Windshield,  RHS Mudguard, Roof etc. damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"RHS Wall damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check, Front Impact\",\"steering_system\":\"To check\",\"suspension\":\"To check for Front leaf Suspension\",\"electrical_system\":\"To check for wirings, Meter, etc.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To check for mountings\",\"axles_chassis\":\"To check for chassis long members and front axle\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"NO\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>Genearal<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"16032503193511\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-03-16 09:49:35'),
