(2500, '21032510224886', 'VP/M/24/11/111', 411, '66', '{\"name_of_consignee\":\"M\\/s Shri Ram Trading Company, Gorakhpur (UP)\",\"salutation\":\"Mr\",\"name_of_commodity\":\"Matar Filter\",\"address\":\"Kushinagar, Uttar Pradesh\",\"available_at_location\":\"yes\",\"cause_loss\":\"the consignment was dispatched from Kanpur Nagar (UP) to Gorakhpur (UP) through vehicle no UP51AT4116 on 19\\/11\\/2024. The motor owner of the said vehicle had financed it from a financier of Kasiya (Kushinagar). The installment of finance due on this truck was not deposited on time. The financier pulled the loaded truck and took it to his warehouse and the goods were emptied in various warehouse. A total of 1000 packets of goods were loaded on this truck. Apart from his 334 packets, 666 packets of goods of other dal mills were loaded. The transporter and the motor owner reached Kasiya and picked up the goods from various warehouse, in which only about 701 packets of goods were received, the remaining 299 packets are short which remained unrecovered from the financier. The material hence returned to the respective consignors in shortage. The short cargo hence noted for each consignor separately. \",\"contact_person_name\":\"Manish\",\"invoices\":[{\"invoicenumber\":\"0679\",\"invoicedate\":\"2024-11-19\"}],\"case_reference\":\"VP\\/M\\/24\\/11\\/111\",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"8840605018\"}', '{\"policy_by\":\"THE NEW INDIA ASSURANCE CO. LTD\",\"appoint_by\":\"THE NEW INDIA ASSURANCE CO. LTD\",\"payment_by\":\"THE NEW INDIA ASSURANCE CO. LTD\",\"selected_policy_vendor_id\":\"\",\"policy_branch\":\"Claims Hub, Kanpur, Kanpur ,Uttar Pradesh - 208002\",\"policy_user\":\"Mr. Amit  Kumar\",\"policy_mobile\":\"+911202782314\",\"policybillingto\":\"1D14014037\",\"selected_appointment_vendor_id\":\"\",\"appointment_gst\":\"09AAACN4165C1Z1\",\"appointment_branch_name\":\"Claims Hub, Kanpur, Kanpur ,Uttar Pradesh - 208002\",\"appointment_user_name\":\"Mr. Amit  Kumar\",\"appointment_mobile_num\"