n\":\"As per statement of driver - loaded with bread, already transferred to another vehicle before spot survey.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of driver, while going, suddenly front running vehicle applied emergency brakes. To save, insured driver also applied brakes but still collided at the back of front vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition shifted to roadside. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Cabin tilted to LHS Side with damaged to major fitments i.e. Front Windshield Glass, Front Bumper, Front Panel, Both Pillars, LHS Headlight, Front Grille, Both Door with fitments, Dashboard with fitments, Roof, Driver Seat, etc damaged. RHS Headlight To Check for Bracket Front Bumper, Grill, etc. Complete cabin pushed back\",\"load_body\":\"Front Wall Dmaged\",\"cooling_system\":\"Damaged.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"Front Leaf Springs Damaged\",\"electrical_system\":\"LHS Headlight, Dashboard with fitments, Wirings etc damaged. RHS Headlight To Check for Bracket. Battery to check\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Mountings.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Misaligned.  Front Axle bent and pushed back.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"No\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"NA\",\"permit\":\"NA\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"22032504561826\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"NA\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"NA\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-03-22 11:26:18'),
