ird_party_particulars\":\"As per FIR \\u2013 HR-74B-1001.\",\"loan_challan\":\"Carrying 56 reels maplitho printing paper \\u2013 239981 kgs GR No. 5218 dated 30.10.2024 ex Muzaffarnagar to Bhopal (Copy of GR Enclosed).\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per FIR, while going, suddenly front running T P Truck No. HR-74B-1001 which was being driven in speed and rash manner, suddenly applied emergency brakes. To save, insured\\u2019s driver also applied brakes but still collided at the back of front vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged. \",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition shifted to road side to avoid traffic jam. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Wooden Cabin with front major fitments i.e. Complete Cowl, Front Bumper, Both Front Glasses, All Front Pillars, All Front Panels, Grille, Both Headlights, Dashboard with fitments, Both Doors with fitments, FUPD, Roof, etc damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"To Check for Front Wall Right Front Corner and Floor Rafters dislocated.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Damaged.\",\"steering_system\":\"Damaged.\",\"suspension\":\"Front Leaf Springs decambed. To Check for Hair Crack.\",\"electrical_system\":\"Both Headlights, Dashboard with fitments, Wirings damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Foundation and front fitments as ROC had pushed on to Engine.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Front Axle dislocated. Chassis Both Long Members Misaligned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"Yes vide P. S. Ecotech 1st, Greater Noida\",\"if_yes\":\"FIR No: 0099 dated 02.11.2024\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"23032503320778\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-03-23 10:02:07'),
