\\/- \",\"aid\":\"28032511385577\",\"natureofjob\":\"62\"}', '{\"registration_date\":\"14-08-2023\",\"chasis_no\":\"MC2CBMRC0PD090840\",\"engine_no\":\"E426CDPD433914\",\"make_model\":\"VE Commercial\\/Eicher PRO 3018 M HSD BSVI\",\"body_type\":\"Open Body\",\"tax_paid\":\"31-03-2025\",\"vehicle_class\":\"goods_carrier\",\"ulw\":\"5632 Kgs\",\"rlw\":\"17750 Kgs\",\"carrying_capacity\":\"2\",\"pre_acccident\":\"Normal\",\"fitness_certificate_no\":\"Not Provided\",\"valid_up_to\":\" 13-08-2025\",\"permit_no\":\"HP2023-NP-3044C\",\"permit_validityfrom\":\"16-08-2023\",\"permit_validity\":\"15-08-2028\",\"permit_type\":\"National Permit Goods Carrier\",\"area_of_operation\":\"All India Consolidated\",\"authorization\":\"NP\\/HR\\/38\\/082024\\/71629\",\"authorization_from\":\"22-08-2024\",\"autharity_validity\":\"22-08-2025\",\"puc\":\"Valid Up To 02.06.2025\",\"survey_date\":\"14-02-2025\",\"name_of_driver\":\"Mr. Taiyab Khan\",\"driving_license_no\":\"To Check\",\"dl_issuedate\":\"To Check\",\"dl_valid\":\"To Check\",\"dob\":\"To Check\",\"issuing_authority\":\"To Check\",\"license_type\":\"To Check\",\"type_of_vehicle_allowed\":\"To Check\",\"verified_driving_license\":\"To Check\",\"endorse\":\"To Check\",\"place_of_accident\":\"Chimanpura\",\"date_of_incident\":\"14.02.2025\",\"time_of_incident\":\"09:30 AM\",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"14-02-2025\",\"date_of_inspection\":\"14-02-2025\",\"place_of_inspection\":\"Spot Of accident\",\"third_party_particulars\":\"NA\",\"loan_challan\":\"Empty at the time of spot survey as per statement.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"While going suddenly at toll plaza rear coming trailer came in speed and steered towards Insured vehicle. Due to this Insured vehilce got uncontrolled and hit the divider and went down road and Insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition shifted to roadside. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Bumper, Both Foot Rest, LHS Door, Both Headlights, Console broken, Steering wheel damaged \",\"load_body\":\"Not Damaged\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check as front impact.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for front leaf spring\",\"electrical_system\":\"Both Headlights Damaged, Wiring damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To check for mountings.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis misaligned. To check for front axle.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"NO\",\"if_yes\":\"NO\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General. <\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>There was no responsible during spot survey as such detailed information not available.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Note - Date of accident as per intimation mail is 12.02.2025 at about 10:05 PM where as per Insured\'s statement(Sheet enclosed) is 14.02.2025 at about 09:30AM.&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"28032511385577\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-03-28 06:08:55'),
