third_party_particulars\":\"As per statement of driver - No\",\"loan_challan\":\"As per statement of driver - Ola Ride ex Chapraula, Greater Noida to Eco-village 1, Greater Noida, UP. Duty Slip To Be Submitted by Insured to Insurance Company directly.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of driver, while going, Suddenly a cow jumped in front of Insured Vehicle and Insured\'s vehicle Steering got broken and vehicle got uncontrolled and collided with the LHS side Big stones and insured vehicle got damaged.  \",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Bumper, Bonnet, Both Headlights, Front Grille, Both Fenders with Linings, Front All Members, Both Side Members, Both Airbags with Module, Dashboard with fitments, Front Panel, Lower Cross Member, Long Members, Aprons etc damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"\",\"cooling_system\":\"damaged with Radiator, Condenser, Fan, Various Pipes, Hoses, Compressor etc.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check. According to Mr. Mohit, Steering got broken due to jumping of cow in front of Car but only due to jumping of cow, steering cannot got broken To Be Checked at Final Survey about Steering Failure being cause of vehicle being uncontrolled \\/ went to extreme left and collided with stones.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for Front Suspension.\",\"electrical_system\":\"Both Headlights, Dashboard with fitments, Wirings etc damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Mountings as Front Major Impact.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Both Front Long Members, Cross Members Suspected damaged.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No \",\"if_yes\":\"No\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>To Check for Steering Failure.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"01042510260044\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Motor Cab\",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-04-01 04:56:00'),
