le was carrying peas (vegetable) at the time of accident which were transferred to another vehicle before Spot Survey. To be checked by Final Surveyor\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"While going, during fog, front running canter vehicle applied emergency brakes. To save, insured driver also applied brakes but still collided at back of front vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged. \",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front complete Cabin pushed back with damages to Front Windshield Glass, Front Bumper, Front Panel, Front Pillars, Grille, FUPD, Headlights, LHS Door with various fitments,   Dashboard, Seats, Floor folded, Roof, Cabin Suspension, etc. damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"LHS Side Wall Bent , Front Wall Bent, To Check \",\"cooling_system\":\"Cooling system apparently damaged\",\"steering_system\":\"Left Side Damaged Steering To Check \",\"suspension\":\"Front Impact To Check \",\"electrical_system\":\"Wiring Damage Left Front major Impact Electronic Component To Check .\",\"engine_transmission\":\"No Direct Impact Foundation To Check \",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis and Front Axle Misaligned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"No\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General, Left Front Major Impact.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"02042512120562\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-04-02 06:42:05'),
