ature_accident\":\"As per statement of Driver, While going suddenly a dumper came from left side, To save Insured driver applied brake but Insured vehicle got unbalanced and got collided at the back of Dumper which caused the damaged to Insured vehicle.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Bumper, FUPD, LHS Head Light, Front Panel, LHS Door Fitments, LHS ORVM, LHS Footrest, Dashboard, Front Windshield Glass & Frame\",\"load_body\":\"Not Damaged\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Check\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check\",\"suspension\":\"To Check Front Leaf Spring\",\"electrical_system\":\"To Check\",\"engine_transmission\":\"Not Damage\",\"axles_chassis\":\"To Check\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"NO\",\"if_yes\":\"NO\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General <\\/p><p>To Check Policy Detail 01:54 Hr 18-.03-2025 to 02-01-2026- PIR If required<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"10042502520585\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-04-10 09:22:05');
