\":\"12-04-2025\",\"policyNumber\":\"215300\\/31\\/2025\\/2349\",\"claim_no\":\"210011\\/31\\/2025\\/00035582\",\"case_reference\":\"VP\\/V\\/25\\/02\\/137\",\"insured_address\":\"Khasra No. 423\\/462,01, Villa Atta Nuh Haryana, 122107\",\"registered_owner\":\"M\\/S. Lions Concrete Pvt. Ltd. \",\"insurancefrom\":\"26-12-2024\",\"insurancefromtime\":\"5:02 PM\",\"insuranceto\":\"25-12-2025\",\"insurancetotime\":\"00:00 Hrs\",\"state\":\"Spot of accident \",\"address\":\"Kotputli, Rajasthan\",\"financers\":\"Indusind Bank Ltd. \",\"sum_insured\":\"Rs. 43,86,000\\/-\",\"aid\":\"12042510295575\",\"natureofjob\":\"62\"}', '{\"registration_date\":\"22-12-2023\",\"chasis_no\":\"MAT828048PAK12496\",\"engine_no\":\"32J95437363 - DIESEL\",\"make_model\":\"Tata Signa 5530.S BS VI  \\/ 2023\",\"body_type\":\"Open Body \",\"tax_paid\":\"30-06-2025\",\"vehicle_class\":\"goods_carrier\",\"ulw\":\"13500 Kgs\",\"rlw\":\"55000 Kgs\",\"carrying_capacity\":\"02 in all\",\"pre_acccident\":\"Normal\",\"fitness_certificate_no\":\"To Check - New Vehicle\",\"valid_up_to\":\"20-12-2025\",\"permit_no\":\"HR2023-NP-3927D\",\"permit_validityfrom\":\"26-12-2023\",\"permit_validity\":\"25-12-2028\",\"permit_type\":\"Goods Carrier National Permit\",\"area_of_operation\":\"All India Consolidated \",\"authorization\":\"NP\\/HR\\/74\\/122024\\/118083\",\"authorization_from\":\"28-12-2024\",\"autharity_validity\":\"21-12-2025\",\"puc\":\"19-12-2025\",\"survey_date\":\"19-02-2025\",\"name_of_driver\":\"Mr. Satish Yadav \",\"driving_license_no\":\"UP75 20080021156\",\"dl_issuedate\":\"12-03-2008\",\"dl_valid\":\"31-05-2026 (NT) & 02.02.2027 (TR)\",\"dob\":\"02-08-1989\",\"issuing_authority\":\"Etawah, UP \",\"license_type\":\"Permanent \",\"type_of_vehicle_allowed\":\"LMV, TRANS & MCWG Only \",\"verified_driving_license\":\"No - Photocopy - RTO Sheet Enclosed\",\"endorse\":\"20.11.2009\",\"place_of_accident\":\"Atta Zone, Sohna Mindhola Road, Sohna, Gurgaon, Haryana\",\"date_of_incident\":\"18-02-2025\",\"time_of_incident\":\"10:30 PM\",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"19-02-2025\",\"date_of_inspection\":\"19-02-2025\",\"place_of_inspection\":\"Spot of Accident\",\"third_party_particulars\":\"As per statement of driver - No.\",\"loan_challan\":\"As per statement of driver - Loaded with Washing Dust vide Invoice Number 1537 dated 18.02.2025. mining Transit Pass No. HBNV1034472165 dated 18.02.2025 from R K Stone Crusher Chimanpura, Rajasthan to Sohna - 40.95 MT. Details To Check by Final Surveyor.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of driver - while unloading the vehicle, suddenly rear tyre got punctured and trailer got unbalanced and overturned to RHS Side and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. The trailer was already detached from Prime Mover and erected on wheels already shifted to side before our spot survey. Overturned photographs given by Insured enclosed. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Not damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"Jack damaged. Trailer Chassis Long Members Bent and Misaligned. All Axles To Check. Floor To Check. All Leaf Springs To Check for Hair Crack. Box Walls, Front & Rear Panels, Triggers Bent. 5th Wheel pin and plate To Check.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Not damaged.\",\"steering_system\":\"Not damaged.\",\"suspension\":\"Prime Mover All Leaf Springs To Check for decambed.\",\"electrical_system\":\"Not damaged.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"Not damaged.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Prime Mover Chassis To Check. Differential To Check. 5th Wheel To Check as trailer overturned while Prime Mover Not Overturned.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"Not till Spot Survey.\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>At the time of Survey, Lift Axle was in lower position, touching the ground. The jack rod was already detached and lying in the box in damaged condition. Overturned vehicle photographs arranged by Insured.&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"12042510295575\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-04-12 04:59:55'),
