Gonsalves\",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"8369379611\",\"insured_name\":\"M\\/s. OKI India Pvt. Ltd.\",\"consignor\":\"M\\/s. OKI India Pvt. Ltd., Taloja, Riagad (MH)\",\"name_of_consignee\":\"M\\/s. State Bank of India, Durg, Dantewada, Raipur, Bastar, Korba, Dongargaon (in Chatissgarh)\",\"cargo\":\"ATM Machines, Recycling Cassettes and RP Rolls\",\"case_reference\":\"VP\\/M\\/24\\/12\\/039\",\"date_of_report\":\"2025-04-17\",\"claim_no\":\"1-5717GU0Q\",\"loss_data\":\"23-11-2024\",\"loss_date_text\":\"\",\"loss_time\":\"\",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"10-12-2024\",\"type_of_loss\":\"Burnt\",\"cause_loss\":\"The consignment carrying vehicle no. MH 04LY 2526 caught fire somehow during the course of transit. Due to fire the consignment inside the vehicle got burnt\\/ damaged. The transporter\\u2019s representative informed about the incident to Expressway Authority. The team of NMSCEW (Nagpur Mumbai Super Communication Expressway) - MSRDC (The Maharashtra State Road Development Corporation) fire brigade Wardha (IC-04) QRV (Quick Response Vehicle) reached and extinguished the fire. The partial material inside the vehicle burnt to ashes and rest material was dispatched to its final destination.\",\"claimant_representative\":\"Mr. Venkat \",\"representative_mobile\":\"7999971868\",\"survey_place\":\"Raipur (CG)\",\"pincode\":\"490001\",\"survey_date\":\"On 10\\/12\\/2024 at consignee\\u2019s place Raipur (CG) and on 13\\/12\\/2024 at Nagpur (MH)\",\"policyNumber\":\"22J17839\",\"packing_description\":\"Standard   &amp; Customary\",\"broker_no\":\"NA\",\"invoicenumber\":[\"MH2425\\/W\\/MC\\/1734\"],\"invoicedate\":[\"2024-11-19\"],\"invoicevalue\":[\"9,28,339.00\"],\"consignment_value\":\"928,339.00\",\"print_estimated_amt\":\"1\",\"estimated_amount\":\"2793994.56\",\"lumsum\":\"Fixed\",\"salvage_amount\":\"0\",\"print_salvage_amt\":\"1\",\"grnumber\":[\"69467\"],\"grdate\":[\"2024-11-21\"],\"claim_assessment\":\"According to the provided Fire Incident Report, the incident was happened on 23\\/11\\/2024. The report for the fire incident was intimated to the fire station on dated 23\\/11\\/2024 which was same dated as the date of incident of fire. The place of fire accident is also mentioned in the report as Nagpur-Mumbai Super Communication Expressway which is similar to the place reported by the insured. \\r\\n\\r\\nThe fire brigade arrived at the incident place on 09:35 hrs. and finished their work approx. in one hour and 23 minutes. According to the fire extinguisher team the vehicle number MH 04LY 2526 (Tata LPT 4830) caught fire during transit towards Nagpur on Nagpur-Mumbai Super Communication Expressway. The incident took place on Saturday morning around 09:30. Reportedly as per driver\\u2019s statement he observed smoke coming from the back of the vehicle. He immediately stopped the vehicle on the side lane &amp; checked &amp; observed that smoke was coming from back side material compartment. He immediately alerted the expressway authority. After that fire extinguishing team reached at the spot doused the fire using firefighting equipment. The goods inside the truck were ATM machines, spare parts, medicines, paper rolls as well as incense sticks and toys etc. which got damaged due to fire.\\r\\n\",\"aid\":\"17042512064461\",\"natureofjob\":\"66\",\"invoices\":[{\"invoicenumber\":\"MH2425\\/W\\/MC\\/1734\",\"invoicedate\":\"2024-11-19\",\"invoicevalue\":\"9,28,339.00\"}],\"gr\":[{\"grnumber\":\"69467\",\"grdate\":\"2024-11-21\"}]}', '', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-04-17 06:36:44'),
