\":\"As per statement of driver - NO.\",\"loan_challan\":\"As per statement of driver - loaded with Chemical drums ex Bhiwandi (Mumbai) to Ghaziabad. To Check by Final Surveyor. \",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"While going, rear coming car driver informed insured\'s driver that material loaded in truck rear portion had caught fire. When Insured driver parked the vehicle on roadside to check, suddenly a drum, loaded in load body got burst and insured vehicle caught fire and insured vehicle burnt. \",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Complete Cowl with all fitments burnt \\/ heated up i.e. All Glasses, Both Headlights, Both Doors, All Front Panels, All Side Panels, Both Doors with fitments, Hood, Front Bumper, Roof with all fitments, Dashboard with all fitments, Seats, Padels, Meter, Upholstry, All Tyres, etc burnt. Rim Heated up and lost temper, Cabin badly burnt with fitments..\",\"load_body\":\"Complete Load body burnt \\/ heated up i.e. Floor, Both Side Walls, Rear Dala, etc Burnt.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Complete Cooling System Burnt \\/ Heated Up.\",\"steering_system\":\"Complete Steering System Burnt \\/ Heated Up.\",\"suspension\":\"All Leaf Springs Heated Up and reverted.\",\"electrical_system\":\"Both Headlights, Dashboard with fitments and All Wirings, Battery, All etc Burnt.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"Badly heated up. External fitments burnt \\/ melted. Transmission, Differential, Propeller shaft, etc badly heated need detailed check up during final survey.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Cross Members Heated Up and Lost tempered and pushed down at centre. All Axles Heated Up with fitments.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"To Check\",\"if_yes\":\"To Check\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>The vehicle is badly Fire damaged.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Fire Report No: UPFS\\/FR\\/2025\\/8001\\/GBN\\/855\\/CFO \\/ Kasana - Truck Fire. Complete Truck and Material loaded in Truck Burnt.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"23042501150619\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-04-23 07:45:06'),
