 No.\",\"loan_challan\":\"As per claim form - Empty Vehicle.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per claim form, at a turning, front coming vehicle sudden came to its wrong side in front of insured\'s vehicle. To save, insured driver steered the vehicle to RHS Side but vehicle got uncontrolled and hit the RHS Foot Path and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition shifted to roadside to avoid traffic jam. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Bumper, FUPD, RHS Headlight, RHS Front Tyre etc damaged.\",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Be Checked.\",\"steering_system\":\"RHS Link Rod damaged. Stabilizer Bar To Check.\",\"suspension\":\"To Check for RHS Front Leaf Springs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"RHS Headlight damaged. Wirings To Check.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check for Foundation.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Front Axle To Check. Chassis RHS Member To Check.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"As per Claim Form - No.\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"23042505020485\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-04-23 11:32:04'),
