 going, suddenly front coming car came and hit the insured vehicle at front and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition already shifted to Police station. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Bumper, RHS Headlight, Front Panel, Front Grille, damaged. LHS Headlight for Inner Bracket.\",\"load_body\":\"Not damaged.\",\"cooling_system\":\"To Be Checked.\",\"steering_system\":\"To Be Checked.\",\"suspension\":\"Front Leaf Springs To Be Checked.\",\"electrical_system\":\"RHS Headlight damaged. LHS Headlight for Inner Bracket.\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Be Checked for Mountings.\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Chassis Long Members Misaligned. To Check for Front Axle.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"To Be Checked.\",\"if_yes\":\"To Be Checked.\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>Insured\'s representative and driver was not available at the time of spot survey, as such we are unable to check whether the vehicle was loaded or not and also claim form not confirming for load and third party particulars.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>As per Permit Part 1 - Authorization valid upto 27-10-2025 while as per RC RTO Sheet, Authorization valid upto 28-10-2025. To Be Checked.<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"27042509412582\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-04-27 16:11:25'),
