ar Dharam Kanta, Khajuri Road, Yamuna Nagar, Haryana\",\"registered_owner\":\"Mr. Krishna Enterprises\",\"insurancefrom\":\"31-05-2024\",\"insurancefromtime\":\"4:47 PM\",\"insuranceto\":\"30-05-2025\",\"insurancetotime\":\"00:00 Hrs\",\"state\":\"Tilhar, Uttar Pradesh\",\"address\":\"Gurgia Bahadurpur,  Bareilly division, Uttar Pradesh\",\"financers\":\"HDFC Bank LTD\",\"sum_insured\":\"Rs. 50,35,000\\/-\",\"aid\":\"06052511070228\",\"natureofjob\":\"62\"}', '{\"registration_date\":\"06-06-2024\",\"chasis_no\":\"MAT783066R1D11293\",\"engine_no\":\"B6.7B62250D06142D64380554-DIESEL\",\"make_model\":\"Tata\\/Signa 4225.T BSVI 10X2\",\"body_type\":\"Tanker\",\"tax_paid\":\"30-06-2025\",\"vehicle_class\":\"goods_carrier\",\"ulw\":\"14000 Kgs\",\"rlw\":\"42000 Kgs\",\"carrying_capacity\":\"2 in all\",\"pre_acccident\":\"Good\",\"fitness_certificate_no\":\"Not Provided\",\"valid_up_to\":\"04-06-2026\",\"permit_no\":\"HR2024-NP-5409B\",\"permit_validityfrom\":\"07-06-2024\",\"permit_validity\":\"06-06-2029\",\"permit_type\":\"National Permit Goods Carrier\",\"area_of_operation\":\"All India Consolidated\",\"authorization\":\"NP\\/HR\\/58\\/062024\\/19552\",\"authorization_from\":\"07-06-2024\",\"autharity_validity\":\"06-06-2025\",\"puc\":\"Valid upto 05-06-2025\",\"survey_date\":\"03-05-2025\",\"name_of_driver\":\"Mr. Ravinder\",\"driving_license_no\":\"UP1720210010928\",\"dl_issuedate\":\"29-10-2021\",\"dl_valid\":\"28-10-2031(NT) 14-02-2028 (TR)\",\"dob\":\"04-06-1986\",\"issuing_authority\":\"RTO, Baghpat\",\"license_type\":\"Permanent-Commercial\",\"type_of_vehicle_allowed\":\"LMV,MCWG & TRANS Only\",\"verified_driving_license\":\"No - Photocopy - RTO Sheet Enclosed\",\"endorse\":\"TRANS w,e,f 15-02-2023\",\"place_of_accident\":\"Gurgia Bahadurpur, Bareilly division, Uttar Pradesh\",\"date_of_incident\":\"02-05-2025\",\"time_of_incident\":\"11:30 PM \",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"03-05-2025\",\"date_of_inspection\":\"03-05-2025\",\"place_of_inspection\":\"Spot Of Accident\",\"third_party_particulars\":\"Front Truck no. not noted as it is sped away\",\"loan_challan\":\"Empty as per statement of Driver\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\" As per statement of driver, while going suddenly front running vehicle applied emergency brakes to save a cow, Insured driver also applied brakes but still collided at the back of front vehicle and insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition shifted to road side. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin With Major LHS Fitments, Front Bumper, FUPD, Front Windshield Glass with Frame, Front Grill, Front Panel, LHS Headlight, RHS Headlight to check, Dashboard,  Roof, LHS Door with Fitments, LHS panel, LHS Side Body, LHS Pillar, LHS Major Fitments, LHS ORVM, etc Major damaged\",\"load_body\":\"Tanker LHS Front corner damaged\",\"cooling_system\":\"Suspected Damaged\",\"steering_system\":\"To Check For LHS Link Rods, Drag link ,Tie Rod, Steering Arm etc damaged, Steering bracket broken \",\"suspension\":\"Front Leaf spring Decambed To check for Hair crack\",\"electrical_system\":\"Headlight damaged, Dashboard with Fitments , Wiring Damaged, Battries Damaged\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To check For Foundation\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Prime Mover Chassis Long Members, Cross member damaged, Front axle bent with linkages\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"NO\",\"if_yes\":\"NO\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"06052511070228\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-05-06 05:37:02'),
