\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"07052502293049\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '6', NULL, '2025-05-07 08:59:30'),
