 that all 99 pipes were damaged.\",\"aid\":\"14052503065080\",\"natureofjob\":\"66\",\"print_estimated_amt\":\"0\",\"invoices\":[{\"invoicenumber\":\"EX2402002014\",\"invoicedate\":\"2025-02-20\",\"invoicevalue\":\"37,82,607.00\"}],\"gr\":[{\"grnumber\":\"1331508\",\"grdate\":\"2025-02-20\"}]}', '', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-05-14 09:36:50'),
