terial EX Shahjahanpur to Hanuman Garh to check by Final Surveyor\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement Of driver, While going suddenly front running vehicle applied emergency brakes. To save, Insured driver also applied brakes but stil collided at bthe back of front vehile and Insured vehilcle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition. Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\" Front Bumper, Front Panel, Front Grill,  Wiper System, Front Wind Shield Glass, RHS Door With Fitments, RHS Headlight, RHS Pillar, RHS Mudguard, RHS ORVM, Dashboard with Fitments Damaged, Floor, Roof Dented \",\"load_body\":\"Front Wall To check\",\"cooling_system\":\"To check Suspected Damaged\",\"steering_system\":\"To check for RHS Link Rod\",\"suspension\":\"Front Leaf spring decambed, To check for Hair Crack\",\"electrical_system\":\"RHS Headlight Damaged, Wiring Damged\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To Check For Foundation\",\"axles_chassis\":\"To Check\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"NO\",\"if_yes\":\"NO\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>General<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"17052510341068\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-05-17 05:04:10'),
