(3207, '17052502571540', 'VP/V/25/04/019', 386, '62', '{\"type_of_vehicle\":\"Goods and Carrier\",\"salutation\":\"Mr\",\"address\":\"Farah, Agra Division\",\"available_at_location\":\"yes\",\"contact_person_name\":\"Manoj Kumar\",\"claim_no\":\"NA\",\"case_reference\":\"VP\\/V\\/25\\/04\\/019\",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"7302709400\",\"policyNumber\":\"1120023124P107865074\",\"insured_name\":\"M\\/s Mohan Logistics Private Limited\",\"tag_vehicle\":\"HR46G5775\",\"vehicle_number\":\"HR46G5775\",\"state\":\"Farah, Agra Division\",\"location_of_survey\":\"281122\",\"prvt_cmrcl\":\"Commercial\"}', '{\"policy_by\":\"UNITED INDIA INSURANCE COMPANY LIMITED\",\"appoint_by\":\"UNITED INDIA INSURANCE COMPANY LIMITED\",\"payment_by\":\"UNITED INDIA INSURANCE COMPANY LIMITED\",\"selected_policy_vendor_id\":\"\",\"policy_branch\":\"BO 1st Floor, Plot No. 78, Above Union Bank of India, Delhi Road, Sonepat, Sonepat ,Haryana - 131001\",\"policy_user\":\"Mr. Jasmeet Kaur\",\"policy_mobile\":\"9416496748\",\"policybillingto\":\"2765897\",\"selected_appointment_vendor_id\":\"\",\"appointment_gst\":\"06AAACU5552C1ZN\",\"appointment_branch_name\":\"BO 1st Floor, Plot No. 78, Above Union Bank of India, Delhi Road, Sonepat, Sonepat ,Haryana - 131001\",\"appointment_user_name\":\"Mr. Jasmeet Kaur\",\"appointment_mobile_num\":\"9416496748\",\"appointbillingto\":\"2765897\",\"selected_payment_vendor_id\":\"\",\"payment_gst\":\"06AAACU5552C1ZN\",\"payment_branch_name\":\"BO 1st Floor, Plot No. 78, Above Union Bank of India, Delhi Road, Sonepat, Sonepat ,Haryana - 131001\",\"payment_user_name\":\"Mr. Jasmeet Kaur\",\"payment_mobile_num\":\"9416496748\",\"paymentbillingto\":\"2765897\",\"salutation\":\"Mr\",\"contact_person_name\":\"Manoj Kumar\",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"7302709400\",\"vehicle_number\":\"HR46G5775\",\"insured_name\":\"M\\/s Mohan Logistics Private Limited\",\"date_of_report\":\"17-05-2025\",\"policyNumber\":\"1120023124P107865074\",\"claim_no\":\"NA\",\"case_reference\":\"VP\\/V\\/25\\/04\\/019\",\"insured_address\":\"Gandhar Mor, 18 KM Stone, Delhi Road, Rohtak\",\"registered_owner\":\"M\\/s Mohan Logistics Private Limited\",\"insurancefrom\":\"28-08-2024\",\"insurancefromtime\":\"1:43 PM\",\"insuranceto\":\"27-08-2025\",\"insurancetotime\":\"00:00 Hrs\",\"state\":\"Farah, Agra Division\",\"address\":\"Farah, Agra Division\",\"financers\":\"HDFC Bank\",\"sum_insured\":\"Rs. 41,96,625\\/-\",\"aid\":\"17052502571540\",\"natureofjob\":\"62\"}', '{\"registration_date\":\"09-09-2024\",\"chasis_no\":\"MC2BUERCORD113058\",\"engine_no\":\"VEDX8*662177*K6*P\\/DIESEL\",\"make_model\":\"Eicher PRO6055\\/1XPTT E CBCBSVI \\/ 2024\",\"body_type\":\"Flat Bed Trailer\",\"tax_paid\":\"30-09-2026\",\"vehicle_class\":\"goods_carrier\",\"ulw\":\"14985 Kgs\",\"rlw\":\"54000 Kgs\",\"carrying_capacity\":\"2 In all\",\"pre_acccident\":\"Good\",\"fitness_certificate_no\":\"Not Provided\",\"valid_up_to\":\"03-09-2026\",\"permit_no\":\"HR2024-NP-3911C\",\"permit_validityfrom\":\"10-09-2024\",\"permit_validity\":\"09-09-2029\",\"permit_type\":\"National Permit Goods Carrier\",\"area_of_operation\":\"All India Consolidated\",\"authorization\":\"NP\\/HR\\/46\\/092024\\/31710\",\"authorization_from\":\"10-09-2024\",\"autharity_validity\":\"09-09-2025\",\"puc\":\"Valid Up to 08-09-2025\",\"survey_date\":\"07-04-2025\",\"name_of_driver\":\"Mr. Manoj Kumar\",\"driving_license_no\":\"UP85 20150010450\",\"dl_issuedate\":\"27-05-2015\",\"dl_valid\":\"26-05-2035 (NT) 22-09-2025 (TR)\",\"dob\":\"To Check\",\"issuing_authority\":\"Mathura, UP\",\"license_type\":\"Permanent - Commercial\",\"type_of_vehicle_allowed\":\"LMV, MCWG & Trans Only\",\"verified_driving_license\":\"No - Photocopy - RC RTO Sheet Enclosed \",\"endorse\":\"To Check\",\"place_of_accident\":\"Farah, Agra Division\",\"date_of_incident\":\"05-04-2025\",\"time_of_incident\":\"03:00 AM\",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"06-04-2025\",\"date_of_inspection\":\"07-04-2025\",\"place_of_inspection\":\"Near Spot of Accident\",\"third_party_particulars\":\"Insured to advised for front vehicle (reportedly sped away), rear vehicle also might be damaged as it had gone below the insured\'s vehicle loadbody platform. Accoding to Mr. Sanjeev, attending spot survey, Rear vehicle details can be provided by police because rear vehicle was already removed before arrival of Mr. Sanjeev at spot..\",\"loan_challan\":\"Loaded with 8 New Farmtrak Tractors Ex Faridabad to Chhattisgarh. Details To Check by Final Surveyor.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of Mr. Sanjeev, While going, suddenly front running vehicle applied emergency brakes. To save, Insured driver also applied brakes but still collided at the back of front vehicle. After some time when police\\/public had taken driver to hospital, reportedly a rear coming car hit and went belowthe Insured vehicle at RHS Rear and Insured vehicle got damaged at Right Front and Right Rear.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition shifted to roadside by removing half axle of prime mover differential . Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Cabin Assy Badly Damaged & Torn at Right side, All Front fitments, Dual Brake Valve, RHS Door Fitments, Roof, Floor, Front Seats, All Panels, Steering Damaged, Left Door Bent - fittings not damaged, DAT Bottle OK, RHS Headlight damaged. LHS Seat Bent, Front Bumper damaged. FUPD Not Damaged. RHS ORVM, Front Grill, Turbo Exhaust Pipe Cracked. Front Windshield Glass, Rear Windscreen Glass damaged and so on. \",\"load_body\":\"Front Wall Damaged, RUPD With Frame Uprooted. Rear Chassis Frame Bent.\",\"cooling_system\":\"Suspected Damged.\",\"steering_system\":\"Damaged. Column Rod Uprooted, Padel, Dipper Indicator etc, damaged.\",\"suspension\":\"Front leaf spring decambed to check for Hair crack. Trailer Rear Axle Leaf Springs also To Check for repairs.\",\"electrical_system\":\"RHS Headlight Damged, Wiring Damged\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To check for Foundation\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Trailer Long Members and Rear Wheel Dead Axle Bent.\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"NA\",\"if_yes\":\"NA\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>Mr. Sanjeev informed that vehicle will be shifted to Eicher workshop at Bilaspur, Haryana.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Note: Driver Mr. Manoj Kumar was removed to Jadon Hospital near Toll. Our representative visited hospital and recorded statement of driver, signed by Mr. Sanjeev (Insured\'s representative).&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"17052502571540\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Goods Carrier \",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '7', NULL, '2025-05-17 09:27:15'),
