"27-06-2024\",\"insurancefromtime\":\"7:12 PM\",\"insuranceto\":\"26-052025\",\"insurancetotime\":\"00:00 Hrs\",\"state\":\"Near Saurikh Stadium in Kannauj, Uttar Pradesh\",\"address\":\"Near Saurikh Stadium in Kannauj, Uttar Pradesh\",\"financers\":\"Mahindra &amp; Mahindra FiNANCIAL Service Limited\",\"sum_insured\":\"Rs. 7,13,450\\/-\",\"aid\":\"24052510533042\",\"natureofjob\":\"62\"}', '{\"registration_date\":\"02-07-2024\",\"chasis_no\":\"MBHCZFB3SRE577957\",\"engine_no\":\"K12NP7523463\\/ PETROL\\/CNG\",\"make_model\":\"Maruti\\/Tour S CNG\",\"body_type\":\"Rigid (Passenger Car)\",\"tax_paid\":\"31-05-2025\",\"vehicle_class\":\"motor_cab\",\"ulw\":\"970 Kgs\",\"rlw\":\"1405 Kgs\",\"carrying_capacity\":\"5 in all\",\"pre_acccident\":\"Normal\",\"fitness_certificate_no\":\"Not Provided\",\"valid_up_to\":\"01-07-2026\",\"permit_no\":\"NOT PROVIDED\",\"permit_validityfrom\":\"13-07-2024\",\"permit_validity\":\"12-07-2029\",\"permit_type\":\"All India Tourist Permit\",\"area_of_operation\":\"All India Consolidated\",\"authorization\":\"AZ\\/UP\\/74\\/072024\",\"authorization_from\":\"17-07-2024\",\"autharity_validity\":\"16-07-2025\",\"puc\":\"01-07-2025\",\"survey_date\":\"16-05-2025\",\"name_of_driver\":\"Mr. Rahul Yadav\",\"driving_license_no\":\"UP7420220009589\",\"dl_issuedate\":\"13-09-2022\",\"dl_valid\":\"Not provided\",\"dob\":\"01-01-2003\",\"issuing_authority\":\"Nil\",\"license_type\":\"Permanent\",\"type_of_vehicle_allowed\":\"LMV & MCWG Only\",\"verified_driving_license\":\"No - Photocopy RC RTO Sheet Enclosed\",\"endorse\":\"NA\",\"place_of_accident\":\"Near Saurikh Stadium in Kannauj, Uttar Pradesh\",\"date_of_incident\":\"15-05-2025\",\"time_of_incident\":\"09:10 PM\",\"survey_allotment_date\":\"16-05-2025\",\"date_of_inspection\":\"16-05-2025\",\"place_of_inspection\":\"Saurikh Police Station\",\"third_party_particulars\":\"Motor Cycle No. UP77AA2191\",\"loan_challan\":\"Insured vehicle carrying one realtive. No Duty slip.\",\"cause_nature_accident\":\"As per statement of driver, While Going suddenly front coming bike hit the Insured vehicle from front & the bike rider fall on the bonnet, roof and fall through rear dickey of Insured vehicle & Insured vehicle got damaged.\",\"particulars_loss_damage\":\"On receipt of instruction from the underwrite office, our representative visited the Police station Saurikh spot of accident. The above vehicle was lying in accidental condition in  Police station Saurikh . Few Photographs of the vehicle taken from different angles to show the position of the vehicle and loss to the subject vehicle. The damages, which could be seen apparently, were noted as far as possible. The damages observed at spot are as under:\",\"show_cabin\":\"Front Bumper, Front Bonnet, RHS Front Fender, RHS Headlight, RHS Fog Lamp,Front Grill,  Radiator Damaged, Roof Dented, Rear Dickey Dented, Airbag,  Front Windshield Glass, Seatbelt , Module Sensor\",\"load_body\":\"\",\"cooling_system\":\"Radiator Damaged, Condenser Damaged\",\"steering_system\":\"Damaged as Right Front impacted\",\"suspension\":\"To check for RHS Suspension\",\"electrical_system\":\"RHS Headlight Damaged, Wiring Damaged\",\"engine_transmission\":\"To check for foundation\",\"axles_chassis\":\"Front Long Member damaged, RHS axle to check\",\"sb1\":\"The caused & extent of damages appeared are probable under the circumstances as reported. Every possible care has been taken to note down the visible losses, other, if any found at the time of final survey, suitable action may please be taken in view the nature of accident.\",\"sb2\":\"After the spot inspection the party was advised to remove the above accidental vehicle to repair workshop & intimate to insurer for arranging final survey.\",\"has_accidenty\":\"Compromised by both Insured & Third Party\",\"if_yes\":\"NO\",\"whether_valid\":\"Yes\",\"rc\":\"No\",\"fitness\":\"No\",\"goods_tax\":\"No\",\"permit\":\"No\",\"remarks\":\"<p>Compromise letter by both partener enclosed. Insured had been requested to submit T.P Affidavit as both parties had aggrement.<\\/p><p>General<\\/p>\",\"aid\":\"24052510533042\",\"vehicle_classText\":\"Motor Cab\",\"goods_taxText\":\"No\",\"rcText\":\"No\",\"fitnessText\":\"No\",\"permitText\":\"No\"}', '', '', '', '', '1', NULL, '2025-05-24 05:23:30'),
(3335, '24052510591865', 'PRM/25/03/010', 411, '12', '{\"salutation\":\"Mrs\",\"address\":\"House No-578, ward No.-33, Gali No-04, Topkhana Bazar, Ambala (HR)-133001\",\"available_at_location\":\"yes\",\"contact_person_name\":\"Neena Gupta\",\"case_reference\":\"PRM\\/25\\/03\\/010\",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"7357178112\",\"policyNumber\":\"93000046242400000016\",\"insured_name\":\"M\\/s Debit Card Holders of AU Small Finance Bank Ltd, Jaipur (Late Mr. Parmod Kumar)\",\"location_of_survey\":\"133001\",\"instruction\":\"NA\"}', '{\"policy_by\":\"THE NEW INDIA ASSURANCE CO. LTD\",\"appoint_by\":\"THE NEW INDIA ASSURANCE CO. LTD\",\"payment_by\":\"THE NEW INDIA ASSURANCE CO. LTD\",\"selected_policy_vendor_id\":\"\",\"policy_branch\":\"Delhi CBO I, 3rd Floor, R G City Centre, Lawrence Road, Keshavpuram, Delhi, New Delhi ,Delhi - 110035\",\"policy_user\":\"Mrs. Sushma \",\"policy_mobile\":\"+918178251086\",\"policybillingto\":\"IN00021548\",\"selected_appointment_vendor_id\":\"\",\"appointment_gst\":\"\",\"appointment_branch_name\":\"Delhi CBO I, 3rd Floor, R G City Centre, Lawrence Road, Keshavpuram, Delhi, New Delhi ,Delhi - 110035\",\"appointment_user_name\":\"Mrs. Sushma \",\"appointment_mobile_num\":\"+918178251086\",\"appointbillingto\":\"IN00021548\",\"selected_payment_vendor_id\":\"\",\"payment_gst\":\"\",\"payment_branch_name\":\"Delhi CBO I, 3rd Floor, R G City Centre, Lawrence Road, Keshavpuram, Delhi, New Delhi ,Delhi - 110035\",\"payment_user_name\":\"Mrs. Sushma \",\"payment_mobile_num\":\"+918178251086\",\"paymentbillingto\":\"IN00021548\",\"salutation\":\"Mrs\",\"contact_person_name\":\"Neena Gupta\",\"contact_person_mobile\":\"7357178112\",\"case_reference\":\"PRM\\/25\\/03\\/010\",\"date_of_report\":\"24-05-2025\",\"insured_name\":\"M\\/s Debit Card Holders of AU Small Finance Bank Ltd, Jaipur (Late Mr. Parmod Kumar)\",\"policytype\":\"Group Personal accident\",\"policyNumber\":\"93000046242400000016\",\"policyNumberfrom\":\"15\\/04\\/2024 \",\"policy